<title>ISRAEL: PLO police use teargas to disperse soccer fans.</title>
<headline>PLO police use teargas to disperse soccer fans.</headline>
<dateline>EL-BIREH, West Bank 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Palestinian police used teargas to disperse hundreds of soccer fans who rioted after a game on Tuesday, witnesses said.</p>
<p>A brawl erupted between fans of opposing teams from the Balata and Amari refugee camps in the West Bank after their match near Ramallah ended in a 1-1 tie.</p>
<p>Palestinian police who intervened were pelted with stones, the witnesses said. Law-enforcers arrested several rioters.</p>
